Package: cyclingpower
Type: Package
Title: Compare readings from multiple cycling power meters
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Zuccollo", , "jameszuccollo@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Read FIT, GPX and CSV ride files recorded by two or more power
    meters, align them onto a common clock, and quantify how their readings
    differ overall and across the power range. Supports linking a third
    meter to the first two through a bridge meter common to both rides. The
    bundled app can also record the meters itself over Web Bluetooth, so
    every source is stamped by one clock.
